      "created_at": "2014-02-17T05:53:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi all, real noobie question here.</p><p>If a villain card says at the end of turn but is&nbsp;played during the end of turn step, do its effects activate?&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:40:23.134Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
