    {
      "id": 92109,
      "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
      "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-02-17T05:59:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>More precisely: &nbsp;End of turn effects trigger in the order the objects came into play. &nbsp;Since the card that just came into play came into play after the effect that put it into play, it is still in line to be triggered after all the other end of turn effects trigger.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This also works the same way with start of turn effects.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:17:56.840Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 9563,
      "topic_slug": "question-about-end-of-turn-effects",
      "display_username": "Arcanist Lupus",
