      "id": 92110,
      "name": "JimmytheRat",
      "username": "JimmytheRat",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/c37758/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-02-17T07:03:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Usually this works against you, like a Stout Barrel pulling out one of the Hayes brothers who immediately shoots someone, or Omnitron pulling out a drone that starts hitting people, but it can also work in your favor.&nbsp; If Omnitron-X plays a component card at the start of his turn using his Electro-Deployment Unit, you'll be able to use that new component right away, since it'll still be the start-of-turn phase.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:17:56.908Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
