      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/5f8ce5/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-02-17T10:41:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, If the Operative drags out an underboss, that underboss then drags out a thug, who then can have his effect text activate as well?</p><p>Seems a little odd. I would have thought that all only cards that were in play at the beginning of the End of turn step would trigger.</p>",
